                     |            |                  |         |
-   ffffffff00000000 |   -4    GB | ffffffff7fffffff |    2 GB | modules
-   ffffffff80000000 |   -2    GB | ffffffffffffffff |    2 GB | kernel, BPF
+   ffffffff00000000 |   -4    GB | ffffffff7fffffff |    2 GB | modules, BPF
